+# fast shock at its speed, beyond the Alfven speed ahead of it, that undoes
+# most of its compression.  The seven-wave residual passes them (it is a
+# residual), the wave-order gate never compares a slow wave with its fast
+# wave when the rotation between them has zero strength, and the planar
+# answers skip the gate.  A wave is refused if (a) it was built as a shock
